WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.943
Share Your Apps: share the apps you build, with people nearby.

00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.553
Publish your apps, right from Code On The Go.

00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:13.264
Buyers scan one code to join your phone's hotspot, and another to open the store.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:18.557
No internet, and no accounts. Just your store, in their browser.

00:00:19.860 --> 00:00:21.967
One tap, and the app is on their phone.

00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:25.592
Share Your Apps, from App Dev for All.

